//! Non-stream Responses bodies (spec § 6.5 non-stream, § 15).
//!
//! The body is parsed with `parse_strict_responses(.., Body)` and checked with
//! `check_numbers_responses(.., Body)` by the caller. [`calls`] then reads `output[]` and applies
